# What the production images (docker/*.Dockerfile, M8-T4) never need from the repository:
# installed packages (each image installs its own, for Linux), build output, local data and
# secrets, test output, and the docs (the API copies the one it serves, docs/api).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.data
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.local
docs
!docs/api
scripts/perf
